{"ID":"20240513083206-aoi6ta3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083206-aoi6ta3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083206-aoi6ta3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513142829-96bck2j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513142829-96bck2j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513142829-96bck2j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:294,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:434\u0026#125;","title":"171","type":"doc","updated":"20240514133208"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513142829-96bck2j","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 945px;","id":"20240513142829-96bck2j","updated":"20240514133208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"152-1 I, A"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"50+ Medium"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008-05-06"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痰不多但咳不止已經五星期， 怕冷。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無胃口"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 身冷"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身痛、有一點汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渴有，喜溫飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無發熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈浮數有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃乾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診：\n3、身體："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表寒裏熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n大青龍湯\n麻黃2錢，桂枝3錢，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"杏仁2錢"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"石膏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5錢"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生薑2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"片，大棗10枚，炙甘草2錢"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"丹皮2錢，桃仁2錢"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2帖"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6→2 bf BS"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"久咳且怕冷故仍有表證，苔黃乾且渴，屬表寒裏熱，故選用大青龍湯加活血化淤藥說明"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(1)大青龍的麻黃與桂枝是用於發散停在表面肌膚的水。杏仁防止發表過度而傷到肺陰。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(2)石膏名為白虎，是清涼解熱的要藥，能清肺胃三焦氣分之熱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(3)胃口不佳表腸胃已傷到，生薑，大棗及炙甘草保護脾胃津液，讓脾胃功能自回。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(4)久咳者必有瘀(支氣管可能咳傷破裂)，故加丹皮桃仁活血化瘀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}